8-30T20:00:22Z","body":"Hi @Fredkiss3 I have the same issue. I even tried reproducing it on codesandbox to report it but for some extremely strange reason, it works as expected there. I used the GitHub example that you posted and as you can see here it doesn't happen.\r\n\r\nhttps://codesandbox.io/p/sandbox/frosty-cloud-9kq36s?file=%2Fapp%2Fabout%2Fpage.tsx%3A8%2C26\r\n\r\nWhat's even stranger is that all (but all) server functions executed before will be duplicated, even if you leave the segment or the layout entierly. Seems that they stay cached somewhere and they re-execute on the server when an action is called. It has something to do with the navigation because it starts happening only after you navigate to a different page.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/next.js/issues/comments/1699758760/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"acomanescu","id":19615017,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NjE1MDE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19615017?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/acomanescu","html_url":"https://github.com/acomanescu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acomanescu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acomanescu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acomanescu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acomanescu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acomanescu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acomanescu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acomanescu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acomanescu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acomanescu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":102368926